<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Falcon Drilling started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Falcon Drilling started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it initiated coverage of Falcon Drilling Co Inc with a strong buy rating.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 7/8 to 39-1/2.</p>
